# models/ and data/circuits/ stay ignored except the frozen serving artifacts —
# Railway builds the worker image from the repo, so the baked triplet, its surrogate
# and the built ribbons must be committed (F-26; decision Q1, 22 Jul 2026). Training
# and ablation run dirs never come in. `dir/*` + negations, not `dir/`: git will not
# descend into a fully ignored directory to honour a re-include.
models/*
!models/headline
!models/era2024
!models/explain
models/explain/*
!models/explain/senna-ppo-6b6edb78d84e-C-00835584
!models/explain/senna-ppo-db031aead155-C-02211840
# the two evaluation-only arrays are reproducible from make explain and serve nothing
models/explain/senna-ppo-6b6edb78d84e-C-00835584/holdout.npz
models/explain/senna-ppo-6b6edb78d84e-C-00835584/crosscheck.npz
models/explain/senna-ppo-db031aead155-C-02211840/holdout.npz
models/explain/senna-ppo-db031aead155-C-02211840/crosscheck.npz
data/cache/
# the ribbon library is a committed artifact (INDEX decision 22 Jul 2026): a clean
# clone must show every buildable circuit, so nothing under data/circuits is ignored
fastf1_cache/
*.parquet
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo

# uv creates this on `uv run`; this project locks via requirements.txt (make lock)
uv.lock
